  "thag1.35:1.1": "Sukhaṃ sukhattho labhate tad ācaraṃ, ",
  "thag1.35:1.2": "kittiñ ca pappoti, yas' assa vaḍḍhati ",
  "thag1.35:1.3": "yo ariyam aṭṭhaṅgikam añjasaṃ ujuṃ ",
  "thag1.35:1.4": "bhāveti maggaṃ amatassa pattiyā ",
  "thag1.35:1.5": "'ti. "
}
